d to celebrate America 250 criticized the government for having a massive fireworks display because of the \u201cair\u201d.\n\nThe Party of No Kings voted in an Islamic Socialist Mayor who handed a Symbolic Pen to a Lawyer who defended the 9-11 terrorists.\n\nThe Party of No Kings wants Socialism over Capitalism and wants to abolish the Senate, border, and all Prisons to give the House all the power.\n\nThe Party of No Kings gave us the Federal Reserve which has absolutely destroyed our dollar by over a 1000% inflation since 1913. The Federal Reserve is not Federal but claims its \u201cGovernors\u201d can\u2019t be fired by President Trump. \n\nDemocrats are the most Anti American Pro Authoritarian Party there is.", "author": "DemPanicAtTheDisco", "created": 1789161259773, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Zennblack", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "RFK's Speech was fantastic\n", "last_comment_created": 1789164311718, "content": "<p>Literally all my grievances in one speech.</p>\n<p>The Party of No Kings tried to instal a Queen without a single vote.</p>\n<p>The Party of No Kings violated everyone\u2019s 1st Amendment right to assemble, practice your religion, and your right to criticize government policy.</p>\n<p>The Party of No Kings sued to keep Trump off the ballot in multiple states including many of Biden\u2019s own Democrat rivals.</p>\n<p>The Party of No Kings is all about my body my choice unless it comes to a vaccine that is neither safe nor effective.</p>\n<p>Notice now how the talking points among Leftists is no one forced you to take the Vaccine.</p>\n<p>Notice now how the guy who claimed \u201cI am the Science\u201d had to plead the 5th 111 times?</p>\n<p>No